WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.734 --> 00:00:13.850
It was our first evening in San Francisco.

2
00:00:13.851 --> 00:00:16.440
Sunny: This is Chinatown.

3
00:00:16.441 --> 00:00:19.767
Hana: Look at the stores and the buildings.

4
00:00:19.768 --> 00:00:22.599
I can hear them speak Chinese.

5
00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:30.377
Bada: Oh no. I can't speak Chinese.

6
00:00:30.378 --> 00:00:31.761
Tom: Don't worry, Bada.

7
00:00:31.762 --> 00:00:33.938
They speak English too.

8
00:00:33.939 --> 00:00:35.449
Bada: Whew!

9
00:00:35.450 --> 00:00:40.052
Tom: Let's go in.

10
00:00:40.053 --> 00:00:42.312
Waiter: Good evening, ladies and gentleman.

11
00:00:42.313 --> 00:00:44.620
Sunny: A table for five, please.

12
00:00:44.621 --> 00:00:47.026
Waiter: Smoking or non-smoking?

13
00:00:47.027 --> 00:00:51.756
Sunny: Non-smoking, please.

14
00:00:51.757 --> 00:00:54.093
Waiter: Right this way, please.

15
00:00:54.094 --> 00:00:57.083
Hana: Ni-hao-ma.

16
00:00:57.084 --> 00:01:00.020
Waiter: Ho.

17
00:01:00.021 --> 00:01:03.233
Tom: I didn't know you spoke Chinese!

18
00:01:03.234 --> 00:01:10.495
Hana: Just the greeting. That's all.

19
00:01:10.496 --> 00:01:12.207
Waiter: Here is the menu.

20
00:01:12.208 --> 00:01:14.403
Let me know when you are ready.

21
00:01:14.404 --> 00:01:18.680
Mom: Thank you.

22
00:01:18.681 --> 00:01:21.307
I love Chinese food.

23
00:01:21.308 --> 00:01:27.788
One day, I would like to visit China!
